#### [MODIFY] [test_global_hotkey.py](file:///c:/github/batmanoverlay.com/tests/unit/test_global_hotkey.py)
- Verify `MSG` structure alignment (`sizeof(MSG) == 48`, `MSG.wParam.offset == 16`).
- Test `Ctrl+Alt+E` registration, failure handling, `WM_HOTKEY` parsing, `restore_and_focus()` transparency preservation, and unregistration lifecycle.

